#{[17592186405153 :question/answer-fields #edb/ref 17592186405188 :agent/gpt-6-astra-ultra] [17592186405153 :question/math-academy-id "q-79044" :org/Math-Academy] [17592186405153 :question/difficulty #edb/ref 17592186045487 :org/Math-Academy] [17592186405153 :question/problem "Calculate the $x$-intercepts of the real locus ${x}^{2}+{y}^{2}-2x+6y+12=0$" :agent/gpt-6-astra-ultra] [17592186405153 :question/id #uuid "f43a31ca-f582-5ca4-a303-c0af1e9c11d4" :org/Math-Academy] [17592186405153 :question/worked-solution "We must have $y=0$ at the $x$-intercepts.  \n\nSo, we need to substitute $y=0$ into the equation of the locus and solve the resulting equation for $x,$ if possible:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}-2x+6y+12 & =0 \\\\ {x}^{2}+{0}^{2}-2x+6\\cdot 0+12 & =0 \\\\ {x}^{2}-2x+12 & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe can solve this equation by completing the square, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}^{2}-2x+1+12 & =0+1 \\\\ (x-1)^{2}+12 & =1 \\\\ (x-1)^{2} & =-11\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince $(x-1)^{2}\\ge 0$ for all values of $x,$ there is no $x$ such that $(x-1)^{2}=-11.$ Therefore, the locus has no $x$-intercepts." :agent/gpt-6-astra-ultra] [17592186405188 :answer-field/choices #edb/ref 17592186405189 :agent/gpt-6-astra-ultra] [17592186405188 :answer-field/choices #edb/ref 17592186405190 :agent/gpt-6-astra-ultra] [17592186405188 :answer-field/choices #edb/ref 17592186405191 :agent/gpt-6-astra-ultra] [17592186405188 :answer-field/choices #edb/ref 17592186405192 :agent/gpt-6-astra-ultra] [17592186405188 :answer-field/choices #edb/ref 17592186405193 :agent/gpt-6-astra-ultra] [17592186405188 :answer-field/type #edb/ref 17592186045493 :agent/gpt-6-astra-ultra] [17592186405188 :answer-field/key "selection" :agent/gpt-6-astra-ultra] [17592186405188 :answer-field/correct #edb/ref 17592186405189 :agent/gpt-6-astra-ultra] [17592186405188 :answer-field/id #uuid "a56e38c9-b83e-56e9-bf4c-ec09e761bb76" :agent/gpt-6-astra-ultra] [17592186405189 :answer/value "The locus has no $x$-intercepts" :agent/gpt-6-astra-ultra] [17592186405190 :answer/value "(2,0)" :agent/gpt-6-astra-ultra] [17592186405191 :answer/value "$(1-\\sqrt{11},0)$ and $(1+\\sqrt{11},0)$" :agent/gpt-6-astra-ultra] [17592186405192 :answer/value "$(2,0)$ and $(5,0)$" :agent/gpt-6-astra-ultra] [17592186405193 :answer/value "(\\sqrt{11},0)" :agent/gpt-6-astra-ultra] [17592186405189 :answer/type #edb/ref 17592186045499 :agent/gpt-6-astra-ultra] [17592186405190 :answer/type #edb/ref 17592186045498 :agent/gpt-6-astra-ultra] [17592186405191 :answer/type #edb/ref 17592186045499 :agent/gpt-6-astra-ultra] [17592186405192 :answer/type #edb/ref 17592186045499 :agent/gpt-6-astra-ultra] [17592186405193 :answer/type #edb/ref 17592186045498 :agent/gpt-6-astra-ultra] [17592186405189 :answer/id #uuid "8b374944-d47a-526e-b651-a9bdd179683c" :agent/gpt-6-astra-ultra] [17592186405190 :answer/id #uuid "6dc41c5f-d7b6-5d05-8b47-2e4e472399bb" :agent/gpt-6-astra-ultra] [17592186405191 :answer/id #uuid "d443e6bd-6dee-5d3a-b69a-1e6b48338e7b" :agent/gpt-6-astra-ultra] [17592186405192 :answer/id #uuid "73af1a99-304f-5788-9f9f-7c5af517eb9b" :agent/gpt-6-astra-ultra] [17592186405193 :answer/id #uuid "eec08ca2-05c0-5cfd-a7e9-7540222dfb9b" :agent/gpt-6-astra-ultra]}
